        "en": "heard of Happy Chick? 🪄\n\n148M+ downloads.\na gaming platform that's already here.\n\nplay games\n→ earn CheePoints\n→ swap them for HYK\n\nyou play.\nyou earn CheePoints.\nthat's HIYOKO's P2E. 😎\n\n#HYK #HIYOKO",
        "ko": "Happy Chick 알아? 🪄\n\n누적 1억 4800만 다운로드.\n이미 여기 있는 게임 플랫폼이야.\n\n게임하면\n→ CheePoint 쌓이고\n→ HYK로 교환 가능\n\n그냥 놀고 있었는데\n가치가 생겨버렸어.\n그게 HIYOKO의 P2E야. 😎\n\n#HYK #HIYOKO"
